-->Include the spring-boot-starter-cache dependency.
-->Add @EnableCaching in main method
-->We have to do caching in service implementation classes
        Get:@Cacheable(cacheNames = "employees",key = "#empId")
        Put:@CachePut(cacheNames = "employees",key = "#employee.empId")
        Delete:@CacheEvict(cacheNames = "employees",key = "#empId")
-->Configuration cache storage: spring.cache.type=simple